@startuml AddTask
title Week 7 — Add a normal task (main success scenario)
actor User
boundary "Task input / Add button" as Input
participant "Add click handler in main.js" as Main
participant "controller: TodoController" as Controller
participant "logging: LoggingTodoServiceDecorator" as Logging
participant "service: TodoService" as Service
participant "builder: TaskBuilder" as Builder
participant "task: Task" as Task
participant "storage: LocalStorageHandler" as Storage
participant "Browser localStorage" as BrowserStorage
participant "renderer: TodoRenderer" as Renderer
boundary "Task container / document" as DOM

note over Controller, Renderer
  Factory has created and injected the service's storage.
  Saved records are loaded and action callbacks are bound.
end note
User -> Input : type "Buy milk" and click Add Task
Input -> Main : click
activate Main
Main -> Controller : addTask(input.value)
activate Controller
Controller -> Logging : addTask(description)
activate Logging
Logging -> Logging : console.log: LOG: addTask, description
Logging -> Service : addTask(description)
activate Service
Service -> Service : validate(description)\ntrim, check length, preserve long-list warning
Service -> Builder : new TaskBuilder(trimmed)
Service -> Builder : build()
activate Builder
Builder -> Task : new Task(builder)
activate Task
Task --> Builder : task with existing persisted fields
deactivate Task
Builder --> Service : task
deactivate Builder
Service -> Service : store(task); tasks.push(task)
Service -> Storage : save(tasks)
activate Storage
Storage -> BrowserStorage : setItem('todo-tasks', JSON.stringify(tasks))
activate BrowserStorage
BrowserStorage --> Storage : undefined
deactivate BrowserStorage
Storage --> Service : undefined
deactivate Storage
Service --> Logging : task.id
deactivate Service
Logging --> Controller : task.id
deactivate Logging
Controller -> Renderer : render(service-compatible object, newId)
activate Renderer
Renderer -> Renderer : build pending/completed rows\nfind oldest pending description
Renderer -> Logging : getWorkloadSummary()
activate Logging
Logging -> Service : getWorkloadSummary()
activate Service
Service --> Logging : workload summary
deactivate Service
Logging --> Renderer : workload summary
deactivate Logging
Renderer -> DOM : update lists, status and title\nbind action callbacks; flash new row
Renderer --> Controller : undefined
deactivate Renderer
Controller --> Main : newId
deactivate Controller
Main -> Input : clear accepted description
deactivate Main
DOM --> User : saved task visible in To do

note over Service, DOM
  Short descriptions return null with no save or redraw.
  Urgent additions use addUrgentTask() and the builder's
  high-priority / URGENT-label recipe, not a type string.
end note
@enduml
